  "interpretation": "All six cases improve median prover and verifier time. Full-Falcon passes the strict one-sided 95% timing gate for both metrics. Arithmetic prover confidence bounds improve; arithmetic verifier intervals overlap baseline, so a strict zero-regression confidence claim is not established for arithmetic verification.",
